        "review_body": "Clothes are nice.  Wash well and wear well.  I have purchased twice now from sport bras yoga pants, and evening clothes.\n\nWhat I am not impressed with is their delivery.  This last order took 6 weeks before it was shipped.  Kept getting updates sorry for the delay, something couldn’t be filled and then finally my order shipped.\n\nA few days after I received my order I got an email to review each product.  Forgetting that an item could not be for filled that showed up for me to review.  I checked my bank and noticed my account wasn’t refunded.  Contacted CS and to my surprise they said oh you have to initiate the refund process.  That on Halara not me.  I did my part, placed an order, paid and waited an exuberant amount of time.  To only be told I need to request a refund befuddled me.  So now I wait once again for my refund which said it would take 7-14 days.  That essentially means it would have taken Halara 2 months to complete a transaction.  \n\nWhile I enjoy the clothes the process needs to overhauled.  I hope you do better.",
        "review_headline": "Clothes are nice! Process takes too long",
