        "review_body": "I first bought these dresses from the TikTok shop and hoped they  lived up to the hype. The day I got them, on went to the Halara website and ordered 3 more. They fit true to size and are good quality. I love the built in bra! As a large breasted woman, I was skeptical that I would be able to go braless, but it provides good support and does not give you the \"uniboob\" look of a sports bra. The dress is comfortable, flattering and I get tons of compliments every time I wear one. They are also versatile and I look forward to wearing them year round by adding a cardigan or jacket in fall and winter. I got free shipping and it shipped quicky. Highly recommend!",
        "review_headline": "You need this dress!",
