        "report": null,
        "review_body": "I love the dress. It’s exactly what I wanted. However, Your marketing is a scam. Half off new users? No it’s only $10 off. That’s not half off a $50 dress. Also the scratch off I got for $100. It’s a bundle if I spend a hundred dollars? Please explain how this works. As what you advertise is not what you get. Unless something is truly onsale  with no high shipping costs, it will be awhile before I order from you all again. The only reason I’m even going off about this, is because I’m being hounded by multiple emails so far since I received the dress only a few days ago. ",
