        "owner_reply": "Hello,\nThank you for sharing your feedback. We're truly sorry to hear about your experience. We understand how frustrating it must have been to go through multiple returns, deal with sizing issues, and be disappointed with the fabric of the items.\nOur team has already reached out to you via email regarding this matter so we can assist you further and work toward the best possible solution. Please kindly check your inbox (including your spam/junk folder) and reply to our email at your convenience.\nThank you for your patience and for giving us the opportunity to make things right.",
